### 📌 Project Overview
An interactive Tableau analytics project analyzing global Electric Vehicle (EV) market trends, manufacturer adoption shares, vehicle type distributions, and battery range evolution across model years.

---

### 🎯 Key Visualizations & Sheets Included
* **Category Sales:** Distribution of Battery Electric Vehicles (BEV) vs. Plug-in Hybrid Electric Vehicles (PHEV) along with average electric range metrics.
* **Manufacturer Share:** Market share representation of major EV automakers (Tesla, Nissan, Chevrolet, BMW, Audi, etc.).
* **Range Trends:** Line chart analysis tracking total electric driving range performance across model years (2000–2020+).
* **Dashboard 1:** Unified executive dashboard combining all primary charts for interactive filtering and drill-down analysis.

